      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hello. I again had this same issue during our ball yesterday. We had about 60 people in the queue, and a performer crashed when they got onstage, and even though they had the role, they weren’t pushed to the top of the queue. And they weren’t able to get in until much later.\n\nI do have some information that might be helpful from this time around. All or most of the performers this time were given the role the day before the event. I’m thinking maybe it has to do with the amount of time before the event they are added to the role? Maybe it takes a couple days to update?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
