      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Another update: So queue priority was working for my mod MimmiPeppermint, who had the role for it long before the event. So now I know for certain that it's because I added new people to the role just a day before the event. The issue in that case is the fact that people who get the role for queue priority still don't get queue priority until a long time after they get the role. I will try to work around this for my future balls by trying to give everyone the role a week before the event, but it would be great if you could still fix this.",
