      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} I just today found out that one of my mods who DID have their account verified by 2FA wasn't able to kick someone from the instance directly without initiating a vote to kick, until I disabled 2FA for it. The problem is, they DID have their account verified by 2FA. And they still weren't able to kick people directly. Just reporting this because this is essentially the same problem I had before, but actually legit this time lol",
