  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi. I host Disney-themed balls in VRChat, and I've had two balls where I had given roles with queue priority out to performers, and then when they crashed and tried to join back, they were pushed to the back of the queue instead of to the front of it.\n\nThis first happened for my Disney Nature's Dance on August 9th. There was like a queue of I think 20-30 people. I was lucky I had my performer in on time for their song. But when I had my Disney Villain's Gala on October 18th, it seemed to be fixed, so I didn't say anything. But it came back again for my Disney Christmas Ball this past weekend.\n\nI want to make sure it's fixed for my next ball, as one time, we had a queue of 40-60 people, and it took people like 1-2 hours to get in.\n\nI so far have only had performers on Windows, so I don't know whether quest users are affected.",
